OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAnthropic researcher believes more than
OL,4,A10% chance AI 'could kill all humans'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after the Financial Times
OL,7,Freported Anthropic withheld its latest
OL,8,Fmodel from the UK's AI Safety Institute
OL,9,F(AISI), one of the leading bodies in
OL,10,Fthe world for assessing AI risk.
OL,12,FThe BBC has approached Anthropic for
OL,13,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
